# Windows 批处理脚本必须用 CRLF 换行，否则 cmd.exe 在 label/goto（:DEPS_OK 等）处解析失败，
# 报「系统找不到指定的批处理标签」「'xxx' 不是内部或外部命令」。锁死 eol=crlf，
# git 检出与 GitHub「下载 ZIP」都会得到 CRLF，且防止编辑器/工具再把它写回 LF。
*.bat text eol=crlf
*.cmd text eol=crlf

# Local voice profiles verify these implementation files by exact SHA-256 bytes.
# Keep the pinned LF representation even when Windows core.autocrlf is enabled.
scripts/ttrpg-local-tts/product-contract.mjs text eol=lf
